{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>東涌發生奪命火警。今日（15日）凌晨4時42分，裕東苑喜東閣一個中層單位冒煙起火，驚動多名住戶報警，大約300人疏散到安全位置。消防員接報到場，</p><p>其間消防員在火場發現一具女性遺體，女死者生前獨居上址。</p><p>根據網上圖片，涉事單位冒出大量濃煙，多人到地下位置暫避。就現場所見，大廈外牆熏黑一片，涉事單位外走廊有一個大型垃圾車。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131852041262600192415907.jpeg/rsBqpycQxUM9auNrwZPa_DsEd2QdwJORaWngI2lp4CM\" alt=\"涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）\"><figcaption>涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131852038141906944286701.jpeg/S6gY_4A8Qr6_0RoYYXXqFZbqoAciWkaHPHvGQTx7xkE\" alt=\"涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）\"><figcaption>涉事單位冒出大量濃煙。（Threads@hei.030_圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131851489854099456824690.jpeg/z2u8kgmZjJDy13oHZBdGSAutJMqSmRaCgQ4ZK4EOGSs\" alt=\"多人到地下位置暫避。（Threads@_blackcat_11_16圖片）\"><figcaption>多人到地下位置暫避。（Threads@_blackcat_11_16圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131877936136196096372584.jpeg/NCc3U042J4WKq8Ei2QtfzjfxuT2iuGpok5plKZOaZSk\" alt=\"消防犬到場調查起火原因。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>消防犬到場調查起火原因。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131880364394942464296345.jpeg/gGP3nlYrvKmpmbUvMVN_YONk6aQYU9rLYsVmKmLFZio\" alt=\"消防員在場調查火警起因。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警起因。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131880367184285696460875.jpeg/ivH2Y7uNmbTWaSrfIiURT9FErbZ3F5dijTZkBI02ZAQ\" alt=\"消防員在場調查火警起因。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>消防員在場調查火警起因。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131877939344969728630874.jpeg/caD_luG2mDtRSZ5-0sOk6Sr_gjRxM9fQZfDXXWXw110\" alt=\"裕東苑喜東閣一個單位起火，女住戶被發現倒斃在內。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>裕東苑喜東閣一個單位起火，女住戶被發現倒斃在內。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131877942511800320083795.jpeg/fKTfH-3yvfwjD9Wi6zk5sleHFVq8w-uk_KkH3_ypB98\" alt=\"裕東苑喜東閣一個單位（白布）起火，女住戶被發現倒斃在內。（黃學潤攝）\"><figcaption>裕東苑喜東閣一個單位（白布）起火，女住戶被發現倒斃在內。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131863889663758336851934.jpeg/coi8PqYELxVI1jThvcIAngoKb-j1BfXUc2uA43NrgOM\" alt=\"早上居民匆匆返工返學。\"><figcaption>早上居民匆匆返工返學。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131863893690421248731842.jpeg/5i639Fzj0n-uoZ79BYkl1yKvxEOxl-2QmsfAe5rHwHs\" alt=\"警方及消防員在場調查火警。\"><figcaption>警方及消防員在場調查火警。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131863897255710720820194.jpeg/9Ov5TZ1rOCPg9TAt4XBSigwIsTvitC188iFR8_IhUfM\" alt=\"警方及消防員在場調查火警。\"><figcaption>警方及消防員在場調查火警。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131863900791640064863452.jpeg/a1xFLArMvXj7iyqp5DpF4glBvaZM9LWYO6Ly7zui8u8\" alt=\"警方及消防員在場調查火警。\"><figcaption>警方及消防員在場調查火警。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131858246521327616948250.jpeg/v7ymTNcwPRgpaGF59DEcDytlj4BuILE5aM1IxlLNSMY\" alt=\"涉事單位外走廊有一個大型垃圾車。\"><figcaption>涉事單位外走廊有一個大型垃圾車。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-15T01:12:55.141732+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":456,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}